TITLE:: SequencerGui
SUMMARY:: Provides a GUI to visually represent sequences created using a Sequencer.
CATEGORIES:: Streams-Patterns-Events
RELATED:: Classes/Sequencer, Classes/PianoRoll, Classes/SequencerKeyRouter

DESCRIPTION::
LINK::Classes/SequencerGui:: provides a visualisation of a graph of LINK::Classes/Pattern::s created using a LINK::Classes/Sequencer::. This is created when calling LINK::Classes/Sequencer#-showGui::. It owns a LINK::Classes/SequencerKeyRouter:: and sets its active context when the user switches between Arrange, Record, and Settings views.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Creates an instance of LINK::Classes/SequencerGui::.

ARGUMENT:: sequencer
The LINK::Classes/Sequencer:: that this LINK::Classes/SequencerGui:: provides a visual representation of.


INSTANCEMETHODS::

PRIVATE:: init
